{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find object, grab it or approach it, then check or handle it in order to complete task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    />\"",
